OL,3,GNEWSAWho decides that Grand Theft Auto 
OL,4,Ais for adults only?                    
OL,6,FThe latest Grand Theft Auto game brings
OL,7,Fthe franchise's trademark violence and 
OL,8,Fadult storytelling to the latest       
OL,9,Fgeneration of gaming hardware.         
OL,11,FBut long before its release, examiners 
OL,12,Fat the Games Rating Authority (GRA),   
OL,13,Fbased in Stevenage, Hertfordshire, got 
OL,14,Fto play the game to decide its         
OL,15,Fappropriate age rating.                
OL,17,FThey analysed its content before       
OL,18,Fassigning a PEGI age rating of 18,     
OL,19,Fwhich covers 38 European territories.  
